"it. She set up shop on %s in %s. I hear she's even lining up a contract with "
"the navy for her improvements."
msgstr "My friend, %s recently quit her job as a ship maintenance technician to set up this side gig. She's been improving ship systems and she's pretty good at it. She set up shop on %s in %s. I hear she's even lining up a contract with the navy for her improvements."

